    "content": "Program: CBTRN02C. Input files and their record layouts:\n\nDALYTRAN: CVTRA06Y DALYTRAN-RECORD (350 bytes)\n  DALYTRAN-ID                  X(16)\n  DALYTRAN-TYPE-CD             X(2)\n  DALYTRAN-CAT-CD              9(4)\n  DALYTRAN-SOURCE              X(10)\n  DALYTRAN-DESC                X(100)\n  DALYTRAN-AMT                 S9(9)V9(2)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-ID         9(9)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-NAME       X(50)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-CITY       X(50)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-ZIP        X(10)\n  DALYTRAN-CARD-NUM            X(16)\n  DALYTRAN-ORIG-TS             X(26)\n  DALYTRAN-PROC-TS             X(26)\n\nXREF: CVACT03Y CARD-XREF-RECORD (50 bytes)\n  XREF-CARD-NUM                X(16)\n  XREF-CUST-ID                 9(9)\n  XREF-ACCT-ID                 9(11)\n\nACCOUNT: CVACT01Y ACCOUNT-RECORD (300 bytes)\n  ACCT-ID                      9(11)\n  ACCT-ACTIVE-STATUS           X(1)\n  ACCT-CURR-BAL                S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-CREDIT-LIMIT            S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-CASH-CREDIT-LIMIT       S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-OPEN-DATE               X(10)\n  ACCT-EXPIRAION-DATE          X(10)\n  ACCT-REISSUE-DATE            X(10)\n  ACCT-CURR-CYC-CREDIT         S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-CURR-CYC-DEBIT          S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-ADDR-ZIP                X(10)\n  ACCT-GROUP-ID                X(10)\n\nTCATBAL: CVTRA01Y TRAN-CAT-BAL-RECORD (50 bytes)\n  TRANCAT-ACCT-ID              9(11)\n  TRANCAT-TYPE-CD              X(2)\n  TRANCAT-CD                   9(4)\n  TRAN-CAT-BAL                 S9(9)V9(2)\n\nRule to test:\n{\n \"id\": \"BR-CBTRN02C-003\",\n \"title\": \"Reject over-limit transaction based on current-cycle credit minus debit plus transaction amount\",\n \"summary\": \"For a found account, the program calculates current-cycle credit minus current-cycle debit plus the transaction amount. If the credit limit is less than the result, it sets reason 102 'OVERLIMIT TRANSACTION' and the transaction is rejected. The account's current balance is not used, and the result is held in a field with fewer integer digits than the account fields.\",\n \"given\": [\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The account record was found for the cross-referenced account ID.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"ACCOUNT-RECORD\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The credit limit, current-cycle credit and current-cycle debit are each signed amounts with 10 integer digits and 2 decimals.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"ACCT-CREDIT-LIMIT\",\n    \"ACCT-CURR-CYC-CREDIT\",\n    \"ACCT-CURR-CYC-DEBIT\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The working balance holds only 9 integer digits and 2 decimals. Integer digits above the 9th are dropped when the result is stored (no ON SIZE ERROR is coded).\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-TEMP-BAL\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  }\n ],\n \"when\": [\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The working balance is calculated as current-cycle credit minus current-cycle debit plus the transaction amount.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-TEMP-BAL\",\n    \"ACCT-CURR-CYC-CREDIT\",\n    \"ACCT-CURR-CYC-DEBIT\",\n    \"DALYTRAN-AMT\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The account credit limit is less than the working balance. If the limit is equal to or greater than the balance, this check passes.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"ACCT-CREDIT-LIMIT\",\n    \"WS-TEMP-BAL\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  }\n ],\n \"then\": [\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The fail reason is set to 102.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": [\n    \"102\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The reason description is set to 'OVERLIMIT TRANSACTION'.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON-DESC\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": [\n    \"OVERLIMIT TRANSACTION\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"Because the fail reason is no longer 0, the transaction is not posted. The reject count goes up by 1 and a reject record is written.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON\",\n    \"WS-REJECT-COUNT\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": [\n    \"0\",\n    \"1\"\n   ]\n  }\n ]\n}"
